---
import cases from '../research/physx.json';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<section id="physics-adaptation" class="physx-section not-prose full-bleed" data-base={base}>
  <div class="physx-wrap">
    <p class="physx-eyebrow">Physical asset generation <span>03 / 03</span></p>
    <div class="physx-heading"><div><h2>From image to<br/>physical asset<span>.</span></h2><p>Explore PhysX-Omni's generated geometry, part descriptions, and physical asset exports across three object categories.</p></div><a href="https://github.com/ziangcao0312/PhysX-Omni" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="source-link">PhysX-Omni ↗</a></div>
    <div class="pipeline" aria-label="PhysX-Omni pipeline"><div><b>01</b><strong>Single image</strong><span>RGB input</span></div><div><b>02</b><strong>Physical understanding</strong><span>Parts · materials · properties</span></div><div><b>03</b><strong>Geometry decoding</strong><span>Part meshes</span></div><div><b>04</b><strong>Asset export</strong><span>URDF / MJCF</span></div></div>
    <div class="physx-explorer"><div class="physx-top"><div><span class="physx-label">Select a case</span><div class="physx-case-buttons" role="group" aria-label="Choose a PhysX-Omni case"><button type="button" data-physx="gso_hammer_v003" aria-pressed="true"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Hammer</button><button type="button" data-physx="gso_box_v004" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> Box</button><button type="button" data-physx="gso_mug_v005" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> Mug</button><button type="button" data-physx="partnet_microwave_7236" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> Microwave</button><button type="button" data-physx="partnet_foldingchair_100526" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> Folding chair</button><button type="button" data-physx="epfl_Lr_bottom_edge_0629" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> Cloth 01</button><button type="button" data-physx="epfl_Lr_top_edge_2_0656" aria-pressed="false"><span class="case-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span> Cloth 02</button></div></div><span id="physx-category" class="physx-pill">Rigid</span></div>
      <div class="physx-stage-grid"><div class="physx-stage"><div class="physx-stage-label"><span>Decoded parts</span><span>PhysX-Omni</span></div><model-viewer id="physx-viewer" src={`${base}/research/physx/gso_hammer_v003/prediction.glb`} alt="PhysX-Omni decoded hammer parts" camera-controls touch-action="pan-y" shadow-intensity="0.5" exposure="1" loading="lazy"></model-viewer><div class="physx-stage-bottom"><span id="physx-state" role="status">Loading 3D asset…</span><span>Drag to rotate · Scroll to zoom</span></div></div>
        <aside class="physx-input"><span class="physx-label">Input image</span><div class="physx-input-frame"><img id="physx-image" src={`${base}/research/physx/gso_hammer_v003/input.png`} alt="Hammer input" /></div><h3 id="physx-case-name">Hammer</h3><p id="physx-dataset">GSO32</p><div class="prediction"><span class="physx-label">Model description</span><strong id="physx-predicted-name">Mallet</strong><span id="physx-part-count">2 decoded parts</span></div></aside></div>
      <div class="physx-detail"><div><span class="physx-label">Predicted parts &amp; materials</span><ul id="physx-parts" class="physx-parts-list"></ul></div><div><span class="physx-label">Case review</span><div id="physx-review" aria-live="polite"></div></div></div>
      <details class="physx-property"><summary>Predicted physical properties <span>Per-part values　＋</span></summary><div class="physx-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Part</th><th>Material</th><th>Density (kg/m³)</th><th>Young’s modulus (GPa)</th><th>Poisson ratio</th></tr></thead><tbody id="physx-property-table"></tbody></table></div></details>
    </div>
    <div class="physx-evaluation"><div class="physx-eval-head"><div><p class="physx-eyebrow">Experiment results</p><h2>Seven real inputs<span>.</span></h2><p>Geometry and export outcomes across rigid, articulated, and deformable cases.</p></div><div class="physx-stats"><div><b>7 / 7</b><span>VLM outputs</span></div><div><b>20 / 20</b><span>Decoded parts</span></div><div><b>6 / 7</b><span>Cases with identified issues</span></div></div></div>
      <div class="physx-chart-legend" aria-label="Chart colors"><span><i class="legend-best"></i> Best displayed value</span><span><i></i> Other values</span></div>
      <div class="physx-metric-grid"><article class="physx-metric"><div class="physx-metric-title"><h3>Chamfer-L1 ↓</h3><span>Lower is better</span></div><div id="physx-cd-chart"></div><div class="physx-axis"><span>0</span><span>0.12</span></div></article><article class="physx-metric"><div class="physx-metric-title"><h3>F-score @ 2% ↑</h3><span>Higher is better</span></div><div id="physx-fs-chart"></div><div class="physx-axis"><span>0%</span><span>100%</span></div></article></div>

      <details class="physx-full"><summary>Full results <span>All seven cases　＋</span></summary><div class="physx-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Category</th><th>Decoded parts</th><th>CD-L1 ↓</th><th>F-score @ 2% ↑</th><th>Case review</th></tr></thead><tbody id="physx-table"></tbody></table></div></details>

      <p class="physx-protocol">Inputs: <a href="https://research.google/blog/scanned-objects-by-google-research-a-dataset-of-3d-scanned-common-household-items/">Google Scanned Objects</a> · <a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/AlbertS666/PartNet-Mobility-USD">PartNet-Mobility-USD</a> · <a href="https://www.epfl.ch/labs/cvlab/data/texless-defsurf-data/">EPFL Texture-less Deformable Surfaces</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script is:inline type="application/json" id="physx-cases" set:html={JSON.stringify(cases).replaceAll('<','\\u003c')} />
</section>
<script>
  import '@google/model-viewer';
  import '../research/physx.js';
</script>
<style is:global>
.physx-section{background:#f6f7f4;color:#141a19;padding:clamp(48px,6vw,88px) 24px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}.physx-wrap{max-width:1320px;margin:auto}.physx-eyebrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #bdc8be;padding-top:14px;color:#47735c;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em}.physx-eyebrow span{color:#6c7772}.physx-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:24px;margin:34px 0}.physx-heading h2,.physx-eval-head h2{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,64px);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:1;color:#17251d;margin:0}.physx-heading h2 span,.physx-eval-head h2 span{color:#71a67c}.physx-heading p,.physx-eval-head>div>p:not(.physx-eyebrow){font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#69746d;margin:16px 0 0;max-width:670px}.source-link{white-space:nowrap;color:#527c5f;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none}.pipeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:#dce3dd;border:1px solid #dce3dd;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin:35px 0 24px}.pipeline>div{background:#fff;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.pipeline b,.physx-label{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#718077;font-weight:700}.pipeline strong{font-size:15px;color:#203c2c}.pipeline span{font-size:12px;color:#89968b}.physx-explorer,.physx-metric,.physx-full,.physx-audit-grid article{border:1px solid #dce3dd;background:#fff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}.physx-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:20px 22px}.physx-case-buttons{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:10px}.physx-case-buttons button{border:1px solid #e1e7e2;background:white;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;color:#657169;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer}.physx-case-buttons .case-icon{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#b54b42}.physx-case-buttons .case-ok .case-icon{color:#477d57}.physx-case-buttons button[aria-pressed=true] .case-icon{color:inherit}.physx-review-line{display:flex;align-items:start;gap:8px;margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#47584c}.physx-review-icon{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15}.physx-review-line.ok .physx-review-icon{color:#477d57}.physx-review-line.error .physx-review-icon{color:#b54b42}.physx-table-scroll td:last-child{white-space:normal;min-width:320px;line-height:1.5}.physx-case-buttons button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#203c2c;border-color:#203c2c;color:white}.physx-pill{border:1px solid #dae5da;border-radius:30px;padding:7px 10px;color:#62826b;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;white-space:nowrap}.physx-stage-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 280px;border-top:1px solid #e5eae6;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eae6}.physx-stage{position:relative;min-width:0;background:#e9ede9}.physx-stage model-viewer{width:100%;height:490px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#f9faf8,#e5eae5);--poster-color:transparent}.physx-stage-label,.physx-stage-bottom{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:20px;right:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;pointer-events:none;color:#6c7772;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em}.physx-stage-label{top:18px}.physx-stage-bottom{bottom:16px;font-size:10px}.physx-input{padding:22px;border-left:1px solid #e5eae6}.physx-input-frame{background:#f2f4f0;border-radius:8px;aspect-ratio:1;display:grid;place-items:center;margin:15px 0}.physx-input-frame img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}.physx-input h3{font-size:21px;margin:12px 0 4px;color:#17251d}.physx-input p,.prediction span:not(.physx-label){font-size:13px;color:#7a857e}.prediction{display:grid;gap:5px;border-top:1px solid #e5eae6;margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px}.prediction strong{font-size:16px;color:#203c2c}.physx-detail{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:22px;padding:19px 22px}.physx-parts-list{list-style:none;margin:10px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:7px}.physx-parts-list li{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f6f8f5;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#304b39}.physx-parts-list .part-name{font-weight:600}.physx-parts-list .part-material{text-align:right;color:#758578;font-size:13px}.physx-detail p{color:#47584c;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:8px 0 0}.physx-evaluation{margin-top:88px}.physx-eval-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px;align-items:end}.physx-eval-head .physx-eyebrow{margin:0 0 34px}.physx-stats{display:flex;gap:25px;justify-content:flex-end}.physx-stats>div{display:grid;gap:7px}.physx-stats b{font-size:28px;color:#203c2c;white-space:nowrap}.physx-stats span{font-size:11px;color:#78847a;line-height:1.5;max-width:120px}.physx-chart-legend{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px;color:#65766a;font-size:13px}.physx-chart-legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.physx-chart-legend i{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:#b8c5ba}.physx-chart-legend .legend-best{background:#315d42}.physx-metric-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px}.physx-metric{padding:24px}.physx-metric-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;margin-bottom:24px}.physx-metric-title h3{font-size:21px;color:#17251d;margin:0}.physx-metric-title>span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#8c998f}.physx-row{margin:0 0 14px}.physx-row-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-size:13px;color:#324b39;margin-bottom:5px}.physx-bar{height:8px;background:#edf1ed}.physx-bar-fill{height:100%;background:#b8c5ba}.physx-bar-fill.is-best{background:#315d42}.physx-axis{border-top:1px solid #e1e7e1;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:8px;color:#8e9a90;font-size:12px}.physx-audit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:16px}.physx-audit-grid article{padding:20px 22px}.physx-audit-grid strong{display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:28px;color:#203c2c}.physx-audit-grid p{font-size:12px;color:#78847a;line-height:1.5;margin:6px 0 0}.physx-full{margin-top:16px}.physx-property{border-top:1px solid #e5eae6}.physx-property summary{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 22px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:650;color:#203c2c;font-size:14px}.physx-property summary span{font-size:12px;color:#93a097;font-weight:400}.physx-property summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.physx-full summary{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:20px 24px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:650;color:#203c2c}.physx-full summary span{font-size:12px;color:#93a097;font-weight:400}.physx-full summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.physx-table-scroll{overflow:auto;padding:0 24px 24px}.physx-table-scroll table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left;font-size:13px}.physx-table-scroll th,.physx-table-scroll td{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #edf1ed;white-space:nowrap}.physx-table-scroll th{color:#738078}.physx-protocol{color:#78847a;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;margin:14px 0 0}.physx-protocol a{color:#527c5f;text-decoration:underline}@media(max-width:820px){.physx-eval-head{grid-template-columns:1fr}.physx-stats{justify-content:flex-start}.pipeline{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:720px){.physx-section{padding:45px 16px}.physx-heading{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}.physx-stage-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.physx-input{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #e5eae6}.physx-input-frame{max-width:200px}.physx-stage model-viewer{height:340px}.physx-stage-bottom span:last-child{display:none}.physx-detail,.physx-metric-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.physx-audit-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.physx-stats{flex-wrap:wrap}.physx-evaluation{margin-top:65px}}
</style>
